{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1561","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"钱塘秋潮图（局部） ［南宋］佚名 作","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"东南形胜，三吴都会，钱塘自古繁华。烟柳画桥，风帘翠幕，参差十万人家。云树绕堤沙，怒涛卷霜雪，天堑无涯。市列珠玑，户盈罗绮，竞豪奢。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"重湖叠𪩘清嘉，有三秋桂子，十里荷花。羌管弄晴，菱歌泛夜，嬉嬉钓叟莲娃。千骑拥高牙，乘醉听箫鼓，吟赏烟霞。异日图将好景，归去凤池夸。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔形胜〕地理形势优越。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔三吴〕指吴兴（今浙江湖州）、吴郡（今江苏苏州）、会稽（今浙江绍兴）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔钱塘〕今浙江杭州，旧属吴郡。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔烟柳画桥〕如烟的柳树，雕饰华丽的桥。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔风帘翠幕〕遮挡门窗的帘子与青绿色的帷幕。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔云树〕高耸入云的树木。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔怒涛卷霜雪〕指汹涌的波涛卷起如霜似雪的白色浪花。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔天堑〕天然壕沟。这里指钱塘江。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔珠玑〕珠宝。玑，不圆的珠。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔罗绮〕绫罗绸缎。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔重湖〕指西湖，分里湖、外湖。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔三秋〕指农历九月。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔桂子〕桂花。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔羌管弄晴，菱歌泛夜〕羌笛在晴空下吹奏，采菱的歌声在夜空中飘荡。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔嬉嬉〕戏乐的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔莲娃〕采莲女。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔高牙〕牙旗，将军之旗。这里借指孙何。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔吟赏烟霞〕指吟咏欣赏山水景色。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔图将〕描绘。将，助词，用于动词之后，无实义。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔归去凤池夸〕意思是，回到朝廷，夸耀杭州的美景。这是委婉称扬孙何因政绩卓著，将入朝执政。凤池，即凤凰池，原指禁苑中的池沼，代指最高行政机关中书省。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"runs":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/dSbIuv1S0WW24Wbp0W6t7tV57L3.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/dSbIuv1S0WW24Wbp0W6t7tV57L3.pdf","text":"Pages from 中国古典文学基本丛书.乐章集校注.薛瑞生.中华书局.1994.pdf","type":"link"},{"text":" (260.4 KB)\n\n","type":"text"},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7XxXAAm8nbcTewjeupCwfeTs0Qy.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7XxXAAm8nbcTewjeupCwfeTs0Qy.pdf","text":"281_311.pdf","type":"link"},{"text":" (559.5 KB)\n\n","type":"text"},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/2BwkShBUqj6a21Nz20XBNEY8vEJ.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/2BwkShBUqj6a21Nz20XBNEY8vEJ.pdf","text":"论柳永词_唐圭璋.pdf","type":"link"},{"text":" (1.6 MB)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"alt":"Here's a single sentence description of","mediaId":"media-3280f122e5bf0d0ab935","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《乐章集校注》中编（中华书局2015 年版）","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"望海潮，词牌名。这首词为赠两浙转运使孙何之作。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"柳永（约987—约1053），字耆卿，原名三变，崇安（今属福建）人，北宋词人。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/2BwkShBUqj6a21Nz20XBNEY8vEJ.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/2BwkShBUqj6a21Nz20XBNEY8vEJ.pdf","text":"论柳永词_唐圭璋.pdf","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7XxXAAm8nbcTewjeupCwfeTs0Qy.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7XxXAAm8nbcTewjeupCwfeTs0Qy.pdf","text":"281_311.pdf","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/dSbIuv1S0WW24Wbp0W6t7tV57L3.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.